## Why This Is Asked
Tests hands-on cryptography, key management, and mobile storage design for secure messaging in fintech.

## Key Concepts
- End-to-end encryption with forward secrecy
- Curve25519 X25519 key agreement
- Double/ratcheting key derivation and per-message keys
- ChaChaPoly AEAD and envelope format
- Key management, rotation, and metadata signing with CryptoKit
- Offline queue persistence in Core Data; APNs synchronization

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode: envelope creation (Swift-like pseudo)
let ephemeral = Curve25519.PrivateKey()
let shared = try ephemeral.sharedSecretFrom(recipientPublicKey)
let root = deriveRootKey(shared, previousRoot)
let messageKey = deriveMessageKey(root, counter)
let box = ChaChaPoly.Seal(plaintext, using: messageKey, nonce: nonce)
let envelope = {ephemeralPub: ephemeral.publicKey, nonce, ciphertext: box.ciphertext, tag: box.tag}
```

